{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是一个 DSH 任务通知插件，通过监听会话事件，在任务结束或需要人工确认时发送状态提醒。它支持 HTTP webhook、A2A agent、MCP 工具桥接和 Windows SAPI 语音通道，并可在确认等待超时后发送优先提醒。用户可配置通知模板、通道回退、队列优先级和内容摘要；模型主动调用的 notify 工具默认关闭。适合希望及时获知 DSH 任务进度或确认请求的用户。安装后默认只监听，不需要额外配置；要实际推送需配置外发通道，语音功能需 Windows。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:217-260","lib/index.js:290-322","lib/triggers.js:62-100","lib/triggers.js:121-239"]}
{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify alerts you to DSH task endings, approval requests, and confirmation timeouts. It sends through configured HTTP, A2A, MCP, or Windows voice channels, with queued delivery and fallback support. Its optional model notify tool is off by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:217-260","lib/index.js:290-322","lib/triggers.js:62-100","lib/triggers.js:121-239"]}
