{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#feature-1","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「任务结束提醒」：任务以配置的完成、报错、阻塞或 token 上限原因结束后，插件按会话发送提醒。新一轮任务在冷却期开始会取消前一条待发提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/triggers.js:62-100"]}
{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#feature-2","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「人工确认通知」：出现 approval 请求或符合开关条件的 ask_user_question 时，插件发送工具名、原因或问题摘要，并记录待处理项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/triggers.js:176-210"]}
{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#feature-3","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「确认超时升级」：确认请求超过设定时限仍未解决时，插件以优先级发送升级通知，可使用指定高优先级通道和已启用的 SAPI 语音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/triggers.js:125-151","lib/index.js:293-307"]}
{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#feature-4","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「多通道通知」：用户配置 HTTP、A2A 或 MCP 通道后，插件按模板构造任务通知并发送；失败时按重试策略尝试备用通道。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:217-260","lib/queue.js:59-80"]}
{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#feature-5","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「模型主动通知」：启用配置后，模型可调用 notify 工具发送自定义消息，可指定通道或请求优先发送；子会话调用不会发出通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:404-414","lib/notify-tool.js:51-76"]}
{"unit_id":"ikashana__dsh-notify#feature-6","repo":"ikashana/dsh-notify","commit":"24a946ebe15308373ca51144472b077665316012","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「Windows 语音播报」：开启 SAPI 并配置模板后，插件使用系统语音合成播报通知；同一时刻只处理一条，等待期间可合并为最新通知或丢弃。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/channels/sapi.js:72-130"]}
